_3166_1":"TH","title":"โลกใบนี้ที่ว่ากลม","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"TR","title":"Çağın Gerisinde Yaşamak","type":""}],"externalIds":{"imdb_id":"tt8132700","wikidata_id":"Q61806618","facebook_id":null,"instagram_id":null,"twitter_id":null},"keywords":[{"id":2800,"name":"psychology"},{"id":11208,"name":"conspiracy theory"},{"id":181914,"name":"science vs religion"},{"id":246948,"name":"flat earth"}],"releaseDates":[{"iso_3166_1":"AU","release_dates":[{"certification":"PG","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"2019-02-28T00:00:00.000Z","type":4}]},{"iso_3166_1":"BR","release_dates":[{"certification":"12","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"en","note":"Netflix","release_date":"2019-03-18T00:00:00.000Z","type":4}]},{"iso_3166_1":"CA","release_dates":[{"certification":"14A","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"Hot Docs","release_date":"2018-04-30T00:00:00.000Z","type":1}]},{"iso_3166_1":"DE","release_dates":[{"certification":"6","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"Netflix","release_date":"2020-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":4}]},{"iso_3166_1":"ES","release_dates":[{"certification":"7","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"Netflix","release_date":"2022-04-04T00:00:00.000Z","type":4}]},{"iso_3166_1":"FR","release_dates":[{"certification":"10","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"Netflix","release_date":"2022-04-04T00:00:00.000Z","type":4}]},{"iso_3166_1":"NL","release_dates":[{"certification":"AL","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"Netflix","release_date":"2020-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":4}]},{"iso_3166_1":"US","release_dates":[{"certification":"","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"2018-11-15T00:00:00.000Z","type":4}]}],"translations":[{"iso_639_1":"en","iso_3166_1":"US","name":"English","english_name":"English","title":"","overview":"Meet the growing, worldwide community of theorists who defend the belief that the Earth is flat while living in a society who vehemently rejects it.","tagline":"See the world in a whole new shape."},{"iso_639_1":"it","iso_3166_1":"IT","name":"Italiano","english_name":"Italian","title":"La Terra è piatta","overview":"Scopri la crescente comunità mondiale dei terrapiattisti che difendono la loro teoria pur vivendo in una società che la rifiuta con veemenza.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pt","iso_3166_1":"BR","name":"Português","english_name":"Portuguese","title":"A Terra é Plana","overview":"Séculos atrás, muitas culturas acreditavam que a Terra era um disco plano. À medida que o pensamento científico e a tecnologia evoluíram, a Terra revelou-se um globo, uma visão amplamente aceita hoje - mas não por todos. O movimento da Terra plana tem visto um recente ressurgimento. Esses teóricos da conspiração negam o modelo científico do globo e se juntam através de convenções, fóruns e plataformas online para discutir seu sistema de crenças. No outro extremo do espectro, a comunidade científica visa combater esse mito ressuscitado, resultando em uma batalha pública cada vez maior de conspirações e anti-intelectualismo. Dando uma olhada completa em todos os lados do debate, Behind the Curve mostra que não importa onde você esteja sobre esta questão, as conversas e as pessoas ao redor são tudo, menos planas.","tagline":"Veja o mundo de uma forma totalmente nova."},{"iso_639_1":"es","iso_3166_1":"ES","name":"Español","english_name":"Spanish","title":"La Tierra es plana","overview":"Una creciente comunidad mundial de teóricos defiende la creencia de que la Tierra es plana mientras que la sociedad a su alrededor la rechaza rotundamente.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"de","iso_3166_1":"DE","name":"Deutsch","english_name":"German","title":"Unter dem Tellerrand","overview":"Die Zahl der Verschwörungstheoretiker weltweit, denen zufolge die Erde flach sei, nimmt zu – trotz einer Gesellschaft, die diese Überzeugung vehement ablehnt.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"fr","iso_3166_1":"FR","name":"Français","english_name":"French","title":"La Terre à plat","overview":"Découvrez une communauté mondiale grandissante de théoriciens qui pensent que la Terre est plate dans une société qui rejette violemment cette croyance.","tagline":"Voyez le monde sous une toute nouvelle forme."},{"iso_639_1":"ko","iso_3166_1":"KR","name":"한국어/조선말","english_name":"Korean","title":"그래도 지구는 평평하다","overview":"지구가 둥글다는 건 모두가 인정하는 사실. 잠깐, ‘모두’가 아니었다. 지구가 평평하다고 확신하는 사람들이 있기 때문. 이들에 따르면 구체 지구 이론은 《트루먼 쇼》 같은 음모이자 속임수라고. 그렇다면 평면 지구 이론의 근거는?","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"sv","iso_3166_1":"SE","name":"svenska","english_name":"Swedish","title":"Platt jord","overview":"Lär känna den växande, världsomspännande kretsen av teoretiker som menar att jorden är platt, samtidigt som de lever i en värld som menar att deras idéer är helt galna.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"tr","iso_3166_1":"TR","name":"Türkçe","english_name":"Turkish","title":"Çağın Gerisinde Yaşamak","overview":"Fikirlerini şiddetle reddeden bir toplumda yaşamalarına rağmen Dünya'nın düz olduğu inancını savunan ve sayıları giderek artan bu global teorisyen topluluğuyla tanışın.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"no","iso_3166_1":"NO","name":"Norsk","english_name":"Norwegian","title":"Jorden er flat","overview":"Møt det voksende, verdensomfattende samfunnet av teoretikere som forsvarer troen på at jorden er flat i et samfunn som avviser det på det sterkeste.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"he","iso_3166_1":"IL","name":"עִבְרִית","english_name":"Hebrew","title":"כדור הארץ שטוח","overview":"מסביב לעולם קיימת קהילה הולכת וגדלה של חובבי קונספירציות, המשוכנעים שהעולם הוא שטוח ומגייסים שפע טיעונים להוכחת התיאוריה הזאת.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ru","iso_3166_1":"RU","name":"Pусский","english_name":"Russian","title":"За изгибом","overview":"В 2018 году на Земле все еще есть люди, которые уверены, что наша планета — плоская и ограничена небесной твердью, с которой тускло светят фонарики-звезды. Таких людей не так уж и мало — существует даже Общество плоской Земли. Почему рациональное мышление и наука все чаще встречают такое искреннее неприятие, как снять стигму с тех, кто верит в антинаучные мифы и научиться говорить с ними?","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"nl","iso_3166_1":"NL","name":"Nederlands","english_name":"Dutch","title":"","overview":"Maak kennis met de groeiende, wereldwijde groep theoretici die ervan overtuigd is dat de aarde plat is, maar leeft in een samenleving die dit idee stellig verwerpt.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"sk","iso_3166_1":"SK","name":"Slovenčina","english_name":"Slovak","title":"Za horizontom","overview":"","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"CN","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"曲率背后","overview":"现代地平说的信仰者在美国越来越多，他们到底是一群什么样的人，过着什么样的生活，又有什么样的想法？在播客与社交媒体时代，这个群体的人是如何走到一起的，又有着怎样的心路历程？这个群体内部又是如何就关于平地上空有没有罩子而互相攻击是政府特工或者蜥蜴人。该纪录片记录了地平说信仰者的生活，以及心理学家们对这个群体产生原因的解释。","tagline":"美国民科：寻找生命的意义"},{"iso_639_1":"el","iso_3166_1":"GR","name":"ελληνικά","english_name":"Greek","title":"Επίπεδη Γη","overview":"Γνωρίστε την αναπτυσσόμενη, διεθνή κοινότητα των συνωμοσιολόγων που υποστηρίζουν ότι η Γη είναι επίπεδη, παρότι ζουν σε μια κοινωνία που το απορρίπτει κατηγορηματικά.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ro","iso_3166_1":"RO","name":"Română","english_name":"Romanian","title":"Orizontul plat","overview":"Descoperă comunitatea mondială de teoreticieni care susțin că Pământul este plat și care trăiesc într-o societate ai cărei membri resping vehement această ipoteză.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pt","iso_3166_1":"PT","name":"Português","english_name":"Portuguese","title":"","overview":"Apresentamos a comunidade global e em crescimento de pessoas que afirmam que a Terra é plana, inserida numa sociedade que rejeita tal ideia com veemência.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ar","iso_3166_1":"SA","name":"العربية","english_name":"Arabic","title":"","overview":"تعرّفوا على مجتمع مُتنامٍ على نطاق عالميّ من مُنظِّرين يدافعون عن الاعتقاد بأنّ الأرض مُسطّحة، بينما يعيشون في مجتمع يرفض ذلك رفضًا شديدًا.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ar","iso_3166_1":"AE","name":"العربية","english_name":"Arabic","title":"","overview":"تعرّفوا على مجتمع مُتنامٍ على نطاق عالميّ من مُنظِّرين يدافعون عن الاعتقاد بأنّ الأرض مُسطّحة، بينما يعيشون في مجتمع يرفض ذلك رفضًا شديدًا.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"es","iso_3166_1":"MX","name":"Español","english_name":"Spanish","title":"Tan plana como un encefalograma","overview":"Conoce a la creciente comunidad de teóricos en el mundo que defienden la creencia de que la Tierra es plana, mientras viven en una sociedad que lo niega rotundamente.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"de","iso_3166_1":"AT","name":"Deutsch","english_name":"German","title":"Unter dem Tellerrand","overview":"Die Zahl der Verschwörungstheoretiker weltweit, denen zufolge die Erde flach sei, nimmt zu – trotz einer Gesellschaft, die diese Überzeugung vehement ablehnt.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"de","iso_3166_1":"CH","name":"Deutsch","english_name":"German","title":"Unter dem Tellerrand","overview":"Die Zahl der Verschwörungstheoretiker weltweit, denen zufolge die Erde flach sei, nimmt zu – trotz einer Gesellschaft, die diese Überzeugung vehement ablehnt.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"HK","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"地球不是圓的","overview":"認識全球規模日益擴大的理論家團體：他們無視社會的強烈反對，仍然堅信地球是平的。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"TW","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"地球圓不圓","overview":"認識全球規模日益擴大的理論家團體：他們無視社會的強烈反對，仍然堅信地球是平的。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"SG","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"地球是平的","overview":"这群来自世界各地的理论家坚信地球是平的，而且有越来越多人加入到这个队伍中。但他们的理论遭到了社会的强烈反对。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pl","iso_3166_1":"PL","name":"Polski","english_name":"Polish","title":"Płaskoziemcy","overview":"Poznaj coraz liczniejszą światową społeczność ludzi, którzy uparcie twierdzą, że Ziemia jest płaska, choć inni za żadne skarby nie chcą im w to uwierzyć.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ja","iso_3166_1":"JP","name":"日本語","english_name":"Japanese","title":"ビハインド・ザ・カーブ －地球平面説－","overview":"\"地球は平らである\"という説がある。科学者や周りか